From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hamster Launcher <noreply@hamsterlauncher.app>
Date: Sat, 8 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tools: look for ARM64EC PE files in arm64ec-windows

get_arch_dir mapped CPU_ARM64EC to "aarch64", but this Wine builds ARM64EC
modules into arm64ec-windows (every output directory and the generated
Makefile dependencies use it). widl therefore searched aarch64-windows for
imported type libraries and failed with "cannot find stdole2.tlb" when
building ATL for the arm64 runtime (ADR 0003). Map CPU_ARM64EC to
"arm64ec" so the build tools agree with where the files are.

Topic: arm64ec
---
 tools/tools.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/tools.h b/tools/tools.h
index 224a738..adfeaba 100644
--- a/tools/tools.h
+++ b/tools/tools.h
@@ -695,7 +695,7 @@ static inline const char *get_arch_dir( struct target target )
         [CPU_x86_64]  = "x86_64",
         [CPU_ARM]     = "arm",
         [CPU_ARM64]   = "aarch64",
-        [CPU_ARM64EC] = "aarch64",
+        [CPU_ARM64EC] = "arm64ec",
     };

     if (!cpu_names[target.cpu]) return "";
--
2.39.5
